{
  "frontmatter": {
    "title": "Finding the story in an ordinary morning",
    "date": "2026-09-10",
    "author": "author:alex",
    "draft": false,
    "tags": [
      "photography",
      "field-notes"
    ],
    "slug": "second-post"
  },
  "body": {
    "root": {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "The best photograph from a walk is not always the one you set out to take. Sometimes it is a doorway catching the first light, a chair outside a closed café, or the quiet stretch of pavement before the deliveries arrive.",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "version": 1,
          "textFormat": 0,
          "textStyle": ""
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "For this exercise, leave the shot list at home and give yourself ",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 1,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "one hour and one street",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "version": 1,
          "textFormat": 0,
          "textStyle": ""
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Look before you lift the camera",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "heading",
          "version": 1,
          "tag": "h2"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Walk the street once without taking a photograph. Notice where the light falls and where people pause. On the return journey, choose three details that belong together.",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "version": 1,
          "textFormat": 0,
          "textStyle": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "version": 1,
          "src": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
          "alt": "Mountain lake beneath a wide sky"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 2,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "An image can give a long article a moment of breathing room. Its description should still make sense when the image cannot be seen.",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "version": 1,
          "textFormat": 2,
          "textStyle": ""
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Build a sequence, not a collection",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "heading",
          "version": 1,
          "tag": "h2"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "A useful sequence has a beginning, a detail, and a change of pace:",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "version": 1,
          "textFormat": 0,
          "textStyle": ""
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 1,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "The wide view:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                },
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": " establish where the reader is.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "listitem",
              "version": 1,
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 1,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "The close detail:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                },
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": " show something they might have missed.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "listitem",
              "version": 1,
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 1,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "The human moment:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                },
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": " a gesture, a trace of activity, or an empty space someone has just left.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "listitem",
              "version": 1,
              "value": 3
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "list",
          "version": 1,
          "listType": "number",
          "start": 1,
          "tag": "ol"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "You do not need an expensive camera for this. You need enough time to notice what changes while you stand still.",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "version": 1,
          "textFormat": 0,
          "textStyle": ""
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Stay a little longer than feels necessary. The first frame is often the obvious one.",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "quote",
          "version": 1
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Keep the edit small",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "heading",
          "version": 1,
          "tag": "h3"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "Pick three photographs rather than twelve.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "listitem",
              "version": 1,
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "Use a consistent crop where it helps the sequence.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "listitem",
              "version": 1,
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "Write captions that add context instead of repeating the image.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "listitem",
              "version": 1,
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "Ask permission before using an identifiable portrait in a commercial story.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "listitem",
              "version": 1,
              "value": 4
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "list",
          "version": 1,
          "listType": "bullet",
          "start": 1,
          "tag": "ul"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Bring it back to the page",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "heading",
          "version": 1,
          "tag": "h2"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "When placing photographs in an article, read the text between them aloud. If each section ends with the same point, one of those sections can probably go.",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "version": 1,
          "textFormat": 0,
          "textStyle": ""
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "For more on making image descriptions useful, see the ",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "W3C image accessibility tutorial",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "link",
              "version": 1,
              "url": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/tutorials/images/",
              "rel": null,
              "target": null,
              "title": null
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "version": 1,
          "textFormat": 0,
          "textStyle": ""
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "The goal is not to document everything you saw. It is to help someone else notice one thing more carefully.",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "version": 1,
          "textFormat": 0,
          "textStyle": ""
        }
      ],
      "direction": null,
      "format": "",
      "indent": 0,
      "type": "root",
      "version": 1
    }
  }
}
